# Cosmogrand Zenith's second mode puts a +1/+1 counter on each creature Bot1 controls. The ability resolves before the
# spell that caused it (ruling 2025-07-25), so the second spell, Ornithopter, is still on the stack and its creature
# gets no counter. The creatures already there (Zenith itself, the Ornithopter from turn 1) each get one; Bot2's
# Ornithopter, which Bot1 does not control, gets none.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Cosmogrand Zenith
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x16

